  <description akvo:type="8" type="2" xmlns:akvo="http://akvo.org/iati-activities">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The project wants to strengthen the capacities and knowledge of the teachers of the Lyc&#xE9;e sectoriel de Formation Professionnelle Agricole en agrumiculture et viticulture (LSFPAV) de Bouch&#xE9;rik, by training on innovative (and sustainable) agricultural practices and incorporating interactive teaching and communication skills in the program. This will enable the trained teachers to teach students effectively on the demands of the labour market, and support them in being agricultural entrepreneurs (agripreneurs)</narrative>
  </description>
